/T (DOSM Datathon 2026 is a premier national datathon organised by the Department of Statistics Malaysia \(DOSM\) in conjunction with the annual celebration of Hari Statistik Negara, observed on 20 October each year. The competition brings together diploma and undergraduate students from higher education institutions across Malaysia to develop innovative solutions using artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data analytics.)
/E (DOSM Datathon 2026 is a premier national datathon organised by the Department of Statistics Malaysia \(DOSM\) in conjunction with the annual celebration of Hari Statistik Negara, observed on 20 October each year. The competition brings together diploma and undergraduate students from higher education institutions across Malaysia to develop innovative solutions using artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data analytics.)
