/T (Guided by the theme, "Leveraging ML and AI to Develop Innovative Solutions for Sustainable Tourism Industry in Malaysia," participants are challenged to transform official statistics into impactful solutions that address real-world issues across the economic, social, environmental, and governance dimensions of sustainable tourism. The competition aims to foster innovation, collaboration, critical thinking, and data-driven decision-making among future data professionals.)
/E (Guided by the theme, "Leveraging ML and AI to Develop Innovative Solutions for Sustainable Tourism Industry in Malaysia," participants are challenged to transform official statistics into impactful solutions that address real-world issues across the economic, social, environmental, and governance dimensions of sustainable tourism. The competition aims to foster innovation, collaboration, critical thinking, and data-driven decision-making among future data professionals.)
