/Title (Established in 1949, the Department of Statistics Malaysia \(DOSM\) is the nation's official statistical agency responsible for collecting, producing, and disseminating official statistics. Through initiatives such as DOSM Datathon 2026, DOSM continues to promote data literacy, encourage the use of official statistics, and inspire the next generation of data innovators to contribute towards Malaysia's sustainable development.)
